        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: National road, AC 22 EME C1 binder layer, 40% recycling
Modern Swiss and European technologies are applied to regional storage facilities, material extraction, and production processes. 
UUID: 0c8e5637-af98-4add-b47d-d91edf24decd
This dataset documents the production, installation, deconstruction and end-of-life treatment of 1 m2 AC 22 EME C1 binder layer for national road in Switzerland.
Location: Switzerland
Technology: Layer thickness 80 mm, service life 30 years. 40 % recycling content
Time period: Review of data currency scheduled after 5 years.
Production volume: 
Sampling: 
Extrapolations: None
Uncertainty adjustments: None
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_0c8e5637-af98-4add-b47d-d91edf24decd.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
